QElectroTech AppImage bundle for Linux
======================================

RESUME
------
These scripts build a binary QElectroTech AppImage bundle for Linux x86_64,
with Qt 6 and the KDE Frameworks QET uses, on an Ubuntu/Xubuntu 24.04 host.

They are adapted from the digiKam AppImage scripts by Gilles Caulier
(digikam/project/bundles/appimage and 3rdparty/ext_kf6), reduced to what
QElectroTech needs.

Location in the QET tree: build-aux/linux/appimage/


